add('3:e',['A3.1.1','A3.3.5'],'A lending database includes private member addresses and loan details. Evaluate giving an external courier unrestricted access compared with a read-only view containing only the delivery fields it needs.','Unrestricted access may make ad hoc queries easy, but reveals unrelated private information and may permit damaging edits. A restricted read-only view supplies the address and dispatch details required for delivery while hiding other records and preventing updates through that interface. View permissions and maintenance are needed; the limited view is preferable for the courier’s defined task.',[(1,'Relevant unrestricted-access convenience.'),(1,'Concrete excessive-disclosure/edit risk.'),(1,'View supplies only required delivery fields.'),(1,'Read-only/restricted permissions reduce harm, with maintenance limitation.'),(1,'Supported contextual judgment.')],[10],status='B',adapt='Retains access-benefit/privacy evaluation but explicitly assesses relational security and views, rather than generic insurance ethics.')
